@startuml

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor "Fitness User" as User <<Primary>>
actor "Open Food Facts" as OFF <<Supporting>>
actor "Data Regulator" as Regulator <<Offstage>>

rectangle "wger" {
    usecase "Create Workout Routine" as UC1
    usecase "Create Nutrition Plan" as UC2
    usecase "Track Body Weight" as UC3
}
User --> UC1 
User --> UC2
User --> UC3

OFF .. UC2 : ingredient data

Regulator .. UC1 : privacy 
Regulator .. UC2 : privacy
Regulator .. UC3 : privacy
@enduml